data: {"id": "d80621293a714f08-thinking-parallel_evidence-2331", "run_id": "d80621293a714f08", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实总结\n\n**Pod 状态**：\n- `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2` 持续 **CreateContainerConfigError** 已 68 分钟，未恢复\n- Pod UID: `80b1ae6c-962d-4773-a9d0-195b269bb457`，调度在 `node2`\n\n**根因证据（来自 kubectl_get_yaml）**：\n- Pod YAML 中 `containerStatuses.app.message` 明确显示：`couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input`\n- Secret `workload-input` 实际只包含 key: `available-key`\n- **结论**：Pod 的容器引用了 Secret 中不存在的 key `unavailable-key`，导致 `CreateContainerConfigError`\n\n**冲突/缺口**：\n1. **Metrics/Lo", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1788426281878, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

